{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05795","headline":"书殿赐宴应制 · 徐安贞","name":"书殿赐宴应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"校文常近日，赐宴忽升天。\n酒正传桮至，饔人捧案前。\n玉阶鸣溜水，清阁引归烟。\n共惜芸香暮，春风几万年。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐安贞","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05795.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05795","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}